UID: SCH-SRC-C-RANDOM
TITLE: Transient random current source
STATEMENT: >>>
The catalog shall provide a transient random current source with ordered positive and negative terminals and distribution, distribution parameters, hold interval and replay seed. Values shall use amperes and waveform time shall use seconds.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Check the held value between draws, replay, and distribution limits.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-SRC-BAT
TITLE: Battery symbol
STATEMENT: >>>
A battery shall have explicit positive and negative terminals and bind to a DC voltage model with a signed voltage.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Verify that replacing the artwork preserves polarity and DC behavior.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-SRC-VCVS
TITLE: Voltage-controlled voltage source
STATEMENT: >>>
A VCVS shall bind output positive and negative, then control positive and negative, and accept a signed voltage gain.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Reverse the control pins and verify the output sign.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-SRC-VCCS
TITLE: Voltage-controlled current source
STATEMENT: >>>
A VCCS shall bind output positive and negative, then control positive and negative, and accept transconductance in siemens.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Compare output current to control voltage times transconductance.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-SRC-CCVS
TITLE: Current-controlled voltage source
STATEMENT: >>>
A CCVS shall bind output terminals, a named current-sensing voltage source and signed transresistance in ohms.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Verify sense orientation and refuse unknown references.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-SRC-CCCS
TITLE: Current-controlled current source
STATEMENT: >>>
A CCCS shall bind output terminals, a named current-sensing voltage source and signed current gain.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Verify sense orientation and refuse unknown references.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-SRC-B
TITLE: Behavioral source
STATEMENT: >>>
A behavioral source shall select voltage or current output, bind typed expressions to explicit node and branch references, and report unsupported operators or analyses.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Check voltage and current expressions and reject missing or cyclic references.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-SRC-SWV
TITLE: Voltage-controlled switch
STATEMENT: >>>
A voltage-controlled switch shall expose conduction and control terminals, on/off resistance, threshold, hysteresis and startup state.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Sweep above and below threshold in both directions and verify branch resistance.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-SRC-SWI
TITLE: Current-controlled switch
STATEMENT: >>>
A current-controlled switch shall expose conduction terminals and a named sense branch with current threshold and hysteresis.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Check both trip directions and missing sense branch refusal.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-SRC-SWE
TITLE: Expression-controlled switch
STATEMENT: >>>
An expression-controlled switch shall accept a typed control expression and explicit on/off states.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Verify the selected branch and refuse unresolved inputs.
<<<
